            <field name="categ_id" ref="medical_core.product_category_medical"/>
            <field name="list_price">500</field>
            <field name="site_requirement">tooth</field>
            <field name="requires_consent" eval="True"/>
            <field name="consent_text" type="html"><p>I agree to the extraction of the tooth listed on this form. The dentist explained the alternatives (keeping the tooth with root canal treatment, or no treatment) and the possible risks: pain, swelling, bleeding, infection, dry socket, damage to neighbouring teeth or fillings, temporary or rarely permanent numbness of the lip or tongue, and sinus involvement for upper back teeth. I will follow the post-operative instructions given to me.</p></field>
